image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1ViOWijZP1bXUphL5oHpd7T0MgI.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Save the Cat\",\"overview\":\"Puss rallies the San Lorenzans to save their town before El Moco blows it to bits. But building an army requires Puss to swallow his pride.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4VEpt2UEK34vLLtcOXpLERGpqXY.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Lost and Foundlings\",\"overview\":\"The orphans compete in a high-stakes contest at the Duchess's command. A strange rumbling shakes things up in San Lorenzo.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jh8FLoqcVHqLu9XjJr2vOBIP8Ed.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"The Scarlet Panther\",\"overview\":\"A notorious loan shark shows up in San Lorenzo and insists that Puss's boots belong to him. But without them, Puss just isn't the same.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aO8CJ88d4e7SQdy2wmuTaKLG8Kc.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Pajuna Serves Spirits\",\"overview\":\"It began as a harmless parlor trick. But when Pajuna summons ghosts from the other side, vengeful spirits start taking over the townsfolk.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hyu0PJUd22reQx42DOvgn5ybklI.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"One Last Job\",\"overview\":\"Assuming it'll be easy, Puss offers to run the Cow and Moone for Pajuna while she's off on an adventure with her old pal, Roz.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/BNOi0z4kEex7STGocc3FgJGjg5.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Like a Fox\",\"overview\":\"A handsome face stirs up jealousy when famed treasure hunter Guy Fox asks a star-struck Dulcinea to join him on his next adventure.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qQcbt9NPoWvCOF5E0288iRF53q6.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Not a Date\",\"overview\":\"Puss and Dulcinea decide to go on a vacation together, though neither of them will admit it's a date. Especially when the whole town comes along.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fJfjxAYwoBga1cobhjJROMYo5t6.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Flock the Boat\",\"overview\":\"The townsfolk look to Puss to stop San Lorenzo's earthquakes. But first, a mission to rescue a pirate captain from the Island of Doom!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eXJ8ipID0280mKhMvDMZ0groQNB.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"All Hail, Puss!\",\"overview\":\"When the sky gods grant Puss divine powers to calm the earthquakes, his oversized ego threatens to turn the whole town against him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a4N8DRL6qINZNsXKJa1BNc0R6AJ.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"The Moving Finger Writes\",\"overview\":\"With the future of the world at stake, Puss and his friends head to the Forbidden Citadel on a mission to find the Great Mage Sino.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8aDmrjvHpm9WWZF4rhCtS5WvTQP.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"And, Having Writ, Moves On\",\"overview\":\"The Great Mage Sino reveals the full history of San Lorenzo -- and the only way to save it, which requires Puss to give up everything.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cZ9GPO3w2DSg7yRPW0KTtj1pOVf.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-26\",\"runtime\":24}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-01-16\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}